            "detailed_description": "Frosty Nights is a First Person horror game that focuses on atmosphere and suspense.<br>The first couple of nights are slow - however later nights will give you little time for caution.<br><br>&quot;Welcome children, to a wonderful, magical, yet grizzly story that old Nicholas never wanted you to know.&quot;<br><br>After the story is said and done. Your own story will begin.<br>That's if you can survive the frosty nights that awaits within:<br><br>•\tThe snowman is not so cute and friendly looking when he's hungry.<br>•\tWatch the ways into your room carefully for any unexpected 'guests'.<br>•\tBe sure to keep the door closed, although getting out of bed may be dangerous.<br>•\tThere are many bangs, bumps, and distractions seen in the corner of your eye. Are they a real danger, or safe to ignore?<br>•\tPrepare yourself, you need something to see in the dark, and something 'hot' to protect yourself.<br>•\tSurvive until the warm sun rises.<br><br><i>Understand</i>",
